Rāma vows swift ruin and orders march --- Rāma notes lucky midday omens and throbbing eye --- Rāma posts Nīla vanguard with flank and rear guards --- Rāma rides center on Hanumān with Lakṣmaṇa on Aṅgada --- Sugrīva launches leaping roaring host southward --- Lakṣmaṇa aboard Aṅgada reads victory omens --- Army crosses Sahya Malaya eating honey breaking trees --- Rāma climbs Mahēndra and beholds teeming ocean --- Rāma camps on shore ordering crossing counsel --- Monkeys gaze at wind-tossed jewelled monster sea